OL,3,GNEWSAPair charged over RAF Fairford
OL,4,Aplot to face trial next November
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo British nationals charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with an alleged plot linked
OL,8,Fto Iran at RAF Fairford last month will
OL,9,Fgo on trial next year, a court has been
OL,10,Ftold.
OL,12,FLondon's Old Bailey heard from lawyers
OL,13,Frepresenting Mohmed Abdulkarim, 24, and
OL,14,F25-year-old Nouman Essghir that the
OL,15,Fpair would be denying wrongdoing, so a
OL,16,Fdate for a four-week trial was set for
OL,17,FWoolwich Crown Court from 22 November
OL,18,F2027.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
