OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAPair charged over RAF Fairford
OL,4,Aplot to face trial next November
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two men, both from London, appeared
OL,7,Fvia videolink charged under the
OL,8,FNational Security Act after vans packed
OL,9,Fwith petrol were driven to the airbase
OL,10,Fin Gloucestershire in September.
OL,12,FJulia Faure Walker, prosecuting, said
OL,13,Fboth defendants were in contact with a
OL,14,Fperson named Ali who was acting "in the
OL,15,Finterests" of Iran.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
